Package: RintegMET
Title: Create iDMET Networks from mzTab-M Files
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Kozo", "Nishida", , "kozo.nishida@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads metabolomics results stored in the mzTab-M format and
    extracts the information needed to build iDMET networks. Files are
    parsed with 'RmzTabM'. Converts the small molecule abundances reported
    for each study variable of an mzTab-M file to a 'SummarizedExperiment'.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    RmzTabM (>= 0.99.3),
    SummarizedExperiment
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Remotes:
    RforMassSpectrometry/RmzTabM
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
